<td id="S4.T1.7.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  32.91</td>
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  30.56</td></tr>
