<th id="S4.T1.7.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  HOICLIP <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">1</a>]</cite></th>
