<td id="S4.T1.7.1.6.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  32.27</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.7.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T1.7.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  Ours (w/ BLIP2)</th>
<th id="S4.T1.7.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  RF-UC</th>
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  <span id="S4.T1.7.1.7.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">42.31</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  <span id="S4.T1.7.1.7.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">40.67</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.7.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  <span id="S4.T1.7.1.7.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">40.99</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.7.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T1.7.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  GEN-VLKT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">4</a>]</cite></th>
<th id="S4.T1.7.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  NF-UC</th>
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  25.05</td>
<td id="S4.T1.7.1.8.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:15.0pt;padding-right:15.0pt;">  23.38</td>
