<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Prompts of MLLM for Captioning</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we demonstrate how we prompt MLLM to generate captions with rich image context and locality information. Specifically, we first provide GPT-4o <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib77" title="" class="ltx_ref">77</a>]</cite> with a detailed description of the HOI task to obtain a basic prompt, which is then manually refined. Second, we enhance the prompt to enable MLLM to generate captions with locality information using the modified prompt. Additionally, we offer an example in the prompt so as to explain how to describe multi-person scenarios (e.g., using ‘a group of’). The final prompt is illustrated in Figure <a href="#A2.F1" title="Figure A ‣ Appendix B Prompts of MLLM for Captioning ‣ Bilateral Collaboration with Large Vision-Language Models forOpen Vocabulary Human-Object Interaction Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F1" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2507.06510v1/text.svg" id="A2.F1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:617/501;" width="617" height="501"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A2.F1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure A</span>: </span><span id="A2.F1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The prompt we adopted to instruct the MLLM to caption images in the LSG component.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
